editions/monroe-1.3/book-01-the-shattered/manuscript/chapter-04.md:127:*[SHATTERED]: Designation assigned where Arbiter evaluation finds practitioner architecture that does not resolve to a single recognised Path. The coupling between practitioner and Path framework presents as broken or incomplete. Ability manifestation in such cases has historically been irregular and difficult to predict, and practitioner risk has been assessed as elevated.*
