editions/monroe-1.3/book-01-the-shattered/manuscript/chapter-04.md-139-He looked at the phrase again, because it was doing a great deal of work. It could mean that they had died trying to use something they did not understand, or it could mean that someone had made sure of it, and he did not have the information to know which. What he suspected, without any evidence yet, was that the person who wrote it down had cared which one was believed, and that this was the only part of the sentence he could trust.
